//! What the Noctua design system ships, embedded.
//!
//! `dist/` is what a page links: the stylesheets in the order they resolve
//! in, the behaviour modules, the palettes and the theme data they read.
//! This crate is that directory, so a consumer who installs from crates.io
//! receives it — Cargo cannot package a file above the package directory,
//! and the directory is above every package that would carry it.
//!
//! ```no_run
//! // build.rs
//! fn main() -> std::io::Result<()> {
//!     noctua_design_dist::write_to("static/dist")
//! }
//! ```
//!
//! `dist/base.html` is the list of links, generated, and the order in it is
//! load-bearing. `dist/bootstrap.html` has to run before the first paint or
//! the page has no palette at all.

